\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Per-language file-level recall on SWE-PolyBench under the windowed protocol of Figure~\ref {fig:scorer-func-recall}. The dashed line marks the retrieval ceiling --- the recall achievable if the gold function set lies in the top-$100$ retriever pool. The fine-tuned 3B scorer (FT Qwen 3B) matches or exceeds GPT-5.3 Codex on Java and Python and tracks it within a few points on JavaScript and TypeScript.}}{11}{figure.caption.44}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:scorer-file-recall}{{3}{11}{Per-language file-level recall on SWE-PolyBench under the windowed protocol of Figure~\ref {fig:scorer-func-recall}. The dashed line marks the retrieval ceiling --- the recall achievable if the gold function set lies in the top-$100$ retriever pool. The fine-tuned 3B scorer (FT Qwen 3B) matches or exceeds GPT-5.3 Codex on Java and Python and tracks it within a few points on JavaScript and TypeScript}{figure.caption.44}{}}
